        Pragmatic Theories Enhance Understanding of Implied Meanings in <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sato%2C+T">Takuma Sato</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kawano%2C+S">Seiya Kawano</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yoshino%2C+K">Koichiro Yoshino</a>
      
