    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Hybrid <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> and Higher-Order Quantum Approximate Optimization for CSA Collateral Management
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jin%2C+T">Tao Jin</a>, 
      
