    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Reasoning Curriculum: Bootstrapping Broad <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Reasoning from Math
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pang%2C+B">Bo Pang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kong%2C+D">Deqian Kong</a>, 
      
