        Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span>-assisted Autonomous Vehicle Recovery from Immobilization
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bao%2C+Z">Zhipeng Bao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Q">Qianwen Li</a>
      
