        SoK: Honeypots &amp; <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>, More Than the Sum of Their Parts?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bridges%2C+R+A">Robert A. Bridges</a>, 
      
